Changelog:

- Added 4 extra settings options:
1. Resolution/Viewport can now be set to a minimum of 15% of your regular display (obviously **not** reccomended and is reserved for real-life computers that need it).
2. Made the MAX setting option for the "sun shadowmap" even more high-quality.
3. Added a setting to make the positional shadowmaps 256 instead of the previous minimum of 512
4. Added a "Shadow distance" setting; closer = higher quality.

- Added tooltips to the settings menu, explaining what each setting does.
